    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Hezekia wa Juda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia orezoeghe kubonya nguma uko mundu wa irika ja miaka mirongo iwi na misanu; ukabonya nguma Jerusalemu miaka mirongo iwi na ikenda. Mae orewangwagha Abija mwai wa Zekaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia ukabonya mecha imbiri ya BWANA, seji ndee Daudi orebonyereghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuielesha Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mori ghwa imbiri, mwaka ghwa imbiri ghwa kubonya nguma kwake, Mzuri Hezekia orerughueghe minyango ya Hekalu, ukaiboisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawireda wakohani na Walawi, ukawikwanya chiaimweri wazenyi iichia cha mashariki ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukawizera, “Nisikirenyi Walawi! Idana kueleshenyi mmbeni, na kuielesha Hekalu ya BWANA, uo Mlungu wa weke ndeyo, mfunye na mbai wuchafu ghuko andenyi ya Andu kwa Wueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weke aba weresowieghe wuloli, wikabonya mawiwi imbiri ya BWANA Mlungu odu; wereleghieghe kuzighana andu kwake kokaia, wikaghaluka na kummbikia mghongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni wikarugha lukumbi; wikarimisha taa; hata ndewifukirie marumba angu kumfunyira Mlungu wa Israeli vizongona vekora andenyi ya Andu kwa Wueli anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo BWANA ukawibonyera wandu wa Juda na Jerusalemu machu, ukawibonya wikaie kilambo cheobosha, cheshinikilwa na kusekwa seji mwawuyawona mmbeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ugho, weke aba wikabwaghwa, na wana wedu wa womi na wa waka, na waka wedu wikadwalwa wunyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana naawuyawona nibonye ilaghano na BWANA, uo Mlungu wa Israeli; eri udiinjire machu ghake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana wana wapo, msekaie msetalagha; BWANA wamsaghue mfukireghe marumba imbiri kwake, na kuwilongoza wandu wimtasagha uo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Walawi wikawuka. Wa kivalwa cha Kohathi, Mahathi mwana wa Amasai, na Joeli mwana wa Azaria; wa kivalwa cha Merari, Kishi mwana wa Abdi na Azaria mwana wa Jehaleleli; wa kivalwa cha Gershoni, Joa mwana wa Zima, na Edeni mwana wa Joa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kivalwa cha Elizafani, Shimri na Jeueli; wa kivalwa cha Asafu, Zekaria na Matania, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kivalwa cha Hemani, Jehueli na Shimei; wa kivalwa cha Jeduthuni, Shemaia na Uzieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu awa wikawikwanya waruna, wikakuelesha, wikangia Hekalunyi wipate kuielesha seji wilaghirilo ni mzuri kunughana na malagho gha BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakohani wikangia kondenyi Hekalunyi, wikafunya wuchafu ghose wereghuwonieghe andenyi ya Hekalu, wikaghuwika wazenyi. Walawi wikaghuduka na kughughenja Vololo ya Kidroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Werezoeghe kuielesha ituku ja imbiri ja mori ghwa imbiri, na ituku ja wunyanya ja ugho mori wikavika lukumbi lwa BWANA; na kwa matuku wunyanya sena wikaielesha Hekalu, na ituku ja ikumi na irandadu ja mori ghwa imbiri wikameria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hekalu kuwikwa wakfu sena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wikangia kwa Mzuri Hezekia wikamzera, “Damerie kuielesha Hekalu yose; madhabahu ekoria vizongona, na vilambo varo vose; meza ewikiria Mkate ghufunyiro kwa Mlungu, na vilambo varo vose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni dawunjire vilambo vose verelegheloghe ni Mzuri Ahazi ingelo userekoghe mloli kwa Mlungu ukibonya nguma; daviboisa dikavielesha, navo veko imbiri ya madhabahu ya BWANA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Mzuri Hezekia ukawuka nakesho, ukawikwanya wabaa wa muzi wikajoka cha Hekalunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikadwa njau mfungade, bauru mfungade, wana wa ng'ondi mfungade, na fwandi mfungade; rikaie kizongona kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a, na kwa wundu ghwa wuzuri, na kwa wundu ghwa Andu kwa Wueli, na kwa wundu ghwa wandu wa Juda. Ukawilaghira wakohani, awo wana wa Haruni wirifunye aighu ya madhabahu ya BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wikabwagha njau, na wakohani wikawada bagha yawo na kuimichira cha madhabahunyi wikabwagha wana wa ng'ondi, na bagha yawo wikaimichira cha madhabahunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko fwandi ra kizongona kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a rikaredwa kwa mzuri na ikwanyiko ja wandu; wikawikiria mikonu yawo aighu yaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakohani wikaribwagha, wikafunya kizongona kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a kwa kudia bagha yaro aighu ya madhabahu, kukaia wupatanisho kwa wundu ghwa wandu wose wa Israeli. Angu mzuri orefunyireghe momu kukaia, kizongona chekora na kizongona kwa wundu ghwa mapatano chifunyo kwa wundu ghwa wandu wose wa Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukawika Walawi andenyi ya Hekalu ya BWANA wiko na banjo, na vinubi na zeze; kunughana na malaghiro gha BWANA oremlaghirieghe Daudi ukimtumia mmboni wa mzuri Gadi, na mlodi Nathani; angu agho malaghiro ghedefuma kwa BWANA ghikiidiria kwa walodi wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walawi wikakaia kimusi na vilambo vebora va Daudi, na wakohani wikakaia na tarumbeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Hezekia ukafunya momu kizongona chekora chifunyo madhabahunyi. Hata iji kizongona chekora chazoya kufunywa, lumbo lom'boria BWANA lukawokwa kwa tarumbeta na vilambo vebora va Daudi uo mzuri wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wose ikwanyikonyi wikatasa, wabori wikabora, wakabi tarumbeta wikarikaba; wikabonya huwo hata kizongona chikasia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji wameria kufunya kizongona, mzuri na wose werekwanyeghe wikaghoghoma na kutasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Hezekia na wabaa wikawilaghira Walawi wimkase BWANA wikitumia malagho gha Daudi na mmboni Asafu. Wikabora makaso kwa kuboilwa, wikaghoghoma na kutasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Hezekia ukaghamba, “Idana angu mwameria kukuwika mmbeni wakfu kwa BWANA, redenyi vizongona na mafunyo gha chawucha Hekalunyi.” Wandu wikareda vizongona na mafunyo gha chawucha; na awo werekoghe na ngolo efunya, wikareda vizongona vekora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wikamfunyira BWANA vizongona vekora njau mirongo mfungade bauru ighana, na wana wa ng'ondi maghana awi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafunyo gha vizongona viwikilo wakfu gherekoghe njau maghana arandadu, ng'ondi elfu idadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wakohani werekoghe watini nandighi, nawo ndeweredimieghe kusicha ivo vizongona vekora vose; kwa huwo wikateselwa ni waruna Walawi kuimeria iyo kazi hata wakohani wazima wameria kukuelesha weni; angu Walawi werekoghe na ngolo ekuelesha weni kuchumba wakohani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aighu ya ivo vizongona vingi vekora, korekoghe na minda ekora kwa wundu ghwa vizongona va mapatano, na divei kwa wundu ghwa vizongona vekora. Kwa chia ihi wudumiki ghwa Hekalu ghukazoya sena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia chiaimweri na wandu wose wikaboilwa kwa wundu ghwa agho Mlungu orekoghe wawibonyera; angu maza iro rerebonyekieghe shwa wori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
